s clearly an Archmaster (or have they gotten rid of all mentions of Eric?)</div> </div> </div> </div> Isn't AWCY more like a loosely organized group of Geniuses with low Obligation who purposefully leave artistic Wonders around to cause Havoc? Their weird messages could be a result of Jabir.<br /> <br /> And how is Eric like an Archmage? Wouldn't Nobody fit that category better?<br /> <br /> What is your headcanon for Dr. Wondertainment?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 07-11-2016, 09:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T14:58:41-07:00","id":930539,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/922136-adapting-the-scp-foundation-s-groups-of-interest-to-cofd?p=930085#post930085\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Isn't AWCY more like a loosely organized group of Geniuses with low Obligation who purposefully leave artistic Wonders around to cause Havoc? Their weird messages could be a result of Jabir.<br /> <br /> And how is Eric like an Archmage? Wouldn't Nobody fit that category better?<br /> <br /> What is your headcanon for Dr. Wonde